  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông cân tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là chân đường cao, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>,  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là hai vectơ đối nhau.\n\t\t\tDo đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> là sai.</li><li>Ta có \n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>,  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\"